    <briefdescription>
<para>Append-only sample lineage tracker interface. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Design constraints:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_i_sample_provenance_tracker_1ab2e3ca3c760d0898f0cf1f102602a5a6" kindref="member">record()</ref> is append-only; no update or delete path exists.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Only opaque source URIs are stored; raw training content must not appear in provenance records.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_i_sample_provenance_tracker_1aa7b1a9bd661514128e863e1fa55006e5" kindref="member">queryLineage()</ref> returns the full transformation DAG, not raw content.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_provenance_tracker" kindref="compound">ProvenanceTracker</ref> (concrete implementation) </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
